Package: tuxdoku
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pygame (>= 2.1)
Section: games
Priority: optional
Description: cheerful penguin logic puzzle (Queens / Star Battle style)
 Tuxdoku is a colourful, pastel logic puzzle game. The N x N board is
 split into N coloured regions; hide exactly one penguin in every row,
 every column and every region so that no two penguins touch, not even
 diagonally. Every generated puzzle has exactly one solution.
 .
 Features mouse play (X marks, drag to mark), three lives per level,
 hints earned with remaining lives, time-based scoring, growing board
 sizes from 5x5 to 10x10, high scores, sound effects and music.
 The user interface is in Hungarian.
